note The frame's camera hooks in graph_phase, after the layout: the fit when one is wanted and the canvas has been placed, then this frame's cell size recorded with a Cell action so rect_at can give pixel rectangles, then the focus node looked up and move_camera, then one GlideStep with the frame's time so a glide in progress advances. The fit runs here rather than inside GraphState because it needs the renderer's Measure for the font metrics.

