note Called when the navigation focus changes, and what it does depends on the steering the graph set before causing the change: a header click (Steering::Click) keeps the camera and the root, so selecting a node on the canvas does not move the canvas under the pointer; an arrow-key walk (Steering::Keys) asks for a look and keeps the root; a change from outside the graph (no steering) asks for a look and drops the kept root. The steering is consumed by the change either way.

