symbol move_camera
lines 0 24
hash 218ddde5c10d54e0
note The one place a camera move is honoured, in priority order: a wanted look at the focus node, then a kept node. A node taller than the canvas is aligned to its top, because its header and its buttons are what the reader came for; centring it would put them off screen. The result goes back as a Look (with the frame's time, for the glide) or Keep action, which also settles the wish. Nothing here moves the camera unless a wish asked for it, so a rebuild or a re-index leaves pan and zoom alone.

step ypiyjw
